MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Seven new anime trainers (Cynthia, Leon, Steven, Alain, Lance, Iris,
Diantha; Ash = his existing Journeys team) with anime-only rosters and
movesets, plus two cups: "Masters 8" (the real bracket) and "M8 Shuffle"
(random pairings). Masters rules: Quarter Finals 3v3, Semi Finals and
Final 6v6, one gimmick (Mega / Z-Move / Dynamax) per battle until the
Final, where each may be used once.

Trainer count 1310 -> 1320 with the trainer-flag region pinned at 1310,
so SaveBlock1 layout (flags, simCustomTrainer8) is unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SgytQvqpTXKZEL4YpnWFE1
