+- **MASTERS EIGHT (v3.1.0)** — the Pokémon Journeys World Coronation Series
+  finals, anime-accurate. Seven new trainers tagged (Masters): Cynthia,
+  Leon, Steven, Alain (his Masters Eight team: Chesnaught, Mega Charizard X,
+  Malamar; his Kalos League team is still there too), Lance, Iris and
+  Diantha, with Ash's Journeys team as the eighth. Every move was shown in
+  the anime, Masters Eight first, then other anime appearances only to
+  reach four; Pokémon that showed fewer keep fewer, and nothing comes from
+  the games. Two new cups: **Masters 8** (the real bracket: Leon–Alain,
+  Lance–Diantha, Cynthia–Iris, Steven–Ash) and **M8 Shuffle** (random
+  pairings). Both run the anime's rules: Quarter Finals are 3v3 (each AI
+  picks its three against the opponent), Semi Finals and the Final are
+  6v6, and each trainer may use ONE of Mega Evolution / Z-Move / Dynamax
+  per battle, until the Final, where each may be used once. Old saves are
+  unaffected
 - **AI Leads (v3.0.0)** — a new **AI Leads** setting (Run Simulation, E4/Boss
   level-cap step, tournament start). **Party Order** leads with the first slot
   like the games; **AI Picks** works like VGC team preview: each AI looks at
